WEBVTT

00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:19.200
Oh, yeah!

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:23.400
Pretty impressive!

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:26.520
What are you looking at?

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:27.800
Boo-ya!

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:31.840
You got shrunk, tiny mouthwash!

00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:33.440
Take that!

00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:36.240
You done been shrunk!

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:38.200
Yello?

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.880
I got the shrink ray, all right.

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:44.480
No, I'm not playing with it.

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:46.000
Gru?

00:00:47.720 --> 00:00:49.480
Don't make me laugh! No.

00:00:49.960 --> 00:00:52.400
P.S., he is not getting the moon,

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:55.400
and P.P.S., by the time
I'm done with him,

00:00:55.480 --> 00:00:56.960
he's gonna be begging for mercy.

00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:00.120
Okay, bye.

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:05.960
Look at you, a little tiny toilet
for a little tiny baby...

00:01:07.320 --> 00:01:09.080
Curse you, tiny toilet!

00:01:13.560 --> 00:01:15.560
Okay, here we are.

00:01:15.640 --> 00:01:17.120
Home sweet home.

00:01:19.480 --> 00:01:22.280
So, this is, like, your house?

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:24.280
Wait a sec...

00:01:24.360 --> 00:01:27.000
You're the guy who pretended
he was a recorded message!

00:01:27.080 --> 00:01:29.000
No, that was someone else.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:43.240
Can I hold your hand?

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:45.000
No.

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:57.160
When we got adopted by a bald guy,

00:01:57.200 --> 00:01:59.520
I thought this'd be
more like Annie.

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:09.320
No, hey!

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:16.280
Kyle, these are not treats.
These are guests.

00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:18.880
Girls, this is Kyle, my

00:02:18.960 --> 00:02:19.960
dog.

00:02:22.680 --> 00:02:23.720
Fluffy doggy!

00:02:28.920 --> 00:02:30.040
What kind of dog is that?

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:32.640
He is a... I don't know.

00:02:33.480 --> 00:02:36.560
Do you really think that this is
an appropriate place for little
kids?

00:02:37.040 --> 00:02:38.640
'Cause it's not.

00:02:39.640 --> 00:02:41.880
No! No! Stay away from there!

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:43.480
It's fragile.

00:02:45.960 --> 00:02:49.280
Well, I suppose the plan will work
with two.

00:02:49.360 --> 00:02:52.040
Hey! It's dark in here.

00:02:54.800 --> 00:02:57.040
It poked a hole in my juice box.

00:03:01.800 --> 00:03:03.000
As you can see,

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:06.440
I have provided everything
a child might need.

00:03:08.240 --> 00:03:09.280
All right.

00:03:10.360 --> 00:03:12.640
Okay. As I was saying... Hey!

00:03:13.800 --> 00:03:14.800
Somebody broke that.

00:03:15.240 --> 00:03:18.760
Okay, okay.
Clearly, we need to set some rules.

00:03:18.840 --> 00:03:20.600
Rule number one.

00:03:20.680 --> 00:03:23.160
You will not touch anything.

00:03:23.240 --> 00:03:25.000
What about the floor?

00:03:25.400 --> 00:03:27.360
Yes, you may touch the floor.

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:28.760
What about the air?

00:03:28.840 --> 00:03:30.840
Yes, you may touch the air!

00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:31.880
What about this?

00:03:34.960 --> 00:03:36.840
- Where did you get that?
- Found it.

00:03:36.920 --> 00:03:40.560
Okay. Rule number two. You will not
bother me while I'm working.

00:03:40.640 --> 00:03:42.440
Rule number three.

00:03:42.520 --> 00:03:46.800
You will not cry or whine
or laugh or giggle

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:49.400
or sneeze or burp or fart!

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:54.200
So, no, no, no annoying sounds.
All right?

00:03:54.280 --> 00:03:56.440
Does this count as annoying?

00:03:59.640 --> 00:04:00.960
Very!

00:04:03.160 --> 00:04:05.640
I will see you in six hours.

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:11.400
Okay, don't worry.
Everything's going to be fine.

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:16.200
We're gonna be really happy here.
Right? Agnes?

00:04:43.600 --> 00:04:46.480
Question. What are these?

00:04:47.360 --> 00:04:50.280
A dozen boogie robots! Boogie!

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:53.680
Look at this. Watch me!

00:04:57.400 --> 00:04:59.960
Cookie robots.
I said cookie robots.

00:05:00.520 --> 00:05:03.000
Why are you so old?

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:07.000
Okay. I'm on it.

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:09.080
Hello?

00:05:24.120 --> 00:05:25.320
TV!

